        {
          "kicker": "Azzurri respect",
          "heading": "Italy captain Nicotera brands Fiji more beatable, yet a side to fear",
          "body": "Italy captain Giacomo Nicotera told his pre-match press conference that the world ranking is an honest guide and called Fiji the more winnable assignment. He also warned that Jake White's side carry incredible individuals, many playing in France's Top 14. He said Italy will need control and organisation in Saturday's Round 6 Test in Udine. Both sides arrive without a win. The Italian federation notes that defeat, or victory without a bonus, would send Fiji into a Twickenham rematch with Italy in the sixth-place final."
