    "388": {
      "date": "2026-11-21",
      "edition": "Saturday 21 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Late change",
          "heading": "Sam Illo ruled out as Thomas Clarkson joins Ireland bench against Springboks",
          "body": "Connacht tighthead prop Sam Illo failed to complete return-to-play protocols after the concussion he took in last week's win over Fiji, SA Rugby Magazine reports. That forces Ireland head coach Andy Farrell into a late change for Saturday's Test. Leinster's Thomas Clarkson takes the No. 18 jersey on the bench and is in line for his first appearance of the Nations Championship's second leg. Connacht's Finlay Bealham has joined the squad as emergency cover. South Africa have promoted lock Franco Mostert to start in place of the injured Ruan Nortjé."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "France beat Springboks 21-19",
          "body": "Scotland's Rory Darge withdraws from Japan Test with shoulder injury."
