    "391": {
      "date": "2026-11-21",
      "edition": "Saturday 21 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "No complacency",
          "heading": "Steve Tandy warns Wales one All Blacks win has not fixed everything",
          "body": "Wales head coach Steve Tandy is guarding against a hangover before Saturday's Test against Australia, a week after the 35-28 defeat of New Zealand. \"We can't assume that because one scoreboard went our way, everything is fixed,\" he told BBC Sport Wales. He added that his side must double down on recovery, training and executing the core areas of their game. The BBC reports that Wales, ninth in the world rankings, remain slight underdogs against the seventh-ranked Wallabies."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "France beat Springboks 21-19",
